---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Kamil Zak">
  <article class="space-y-6">
    <section class="flex flex-col space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">
        Hi, I'm Kamil <img
          src="https://emojicdn.elk.sh/👋"
          alt="👋"
          class="mb-1 ml-1 inline w-10 h-10 wave"
        />
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#1b1b1b] text-sm font-normal 3xl:text-base">
        I'm a 25-year-old full-stack software engineer from Poland, now based in the United Kingdom.
        I'm passionate about system architecture, web infrastructure, and distributed systems,
        tackling challenges in system design and scalability while writing clean, maintainable code.
        I work with Python/Java for backend, React/TypeScript/Tailwind for frontend, and AWS for
        cloud infrastructure.
      </p>
      <nav class="flex flex-row space-x-2" aria-label="Social Media Hyperlinks">
        <a href="https://github.com/k9mil" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="github">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            style="fill: #1b1b1b;transform: ;msFilter:;"
            ><path
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              clip-rule="evenodd"
              d="M12.026 2c-5.509 0-9.974 4.465-9.974 9.974 0 4.406 2.857 8.145 6.821 9.465.499.09.679-.217.679-.481 0-.237-.008-.865-.011-1.696-2.775.602-3.361-1.338-3.361-1.338-.452-1.152-1.107-1.459-1.107-1.459-.905-.619.069-.605.069-.605 1.002.07 1.527 1.028 1.527 1.028.89 1.524 2.336 1.084 2.902.829.091-.645.351-1.085.635-1.334-2.214-.251-4.542-1.107-4.542-4.93 0-1.087.389-1.979 1.024-2.675-.101-.253-.446-1.268.099-2.64 0 0 .837-.269 2.742 1.021a9.582 9.582 0 0 1 2.496-.336 9.554 9.554 0 0 1 2.496.336c1.906-1.291 2.742-1.021 2.742-1.021.545 1.372.203 2.387.099 2.64.64.696 1.024 1.587 1.024 2.675 0 3.833-2.33 4.675-4.552 4.922.355.308.675.916.675 1.846 0 1.334-.012 2.41-.012 2.737 0 .267.178.577.687.479C19.146 20.115 22 16.379 22 11.974 22 6.465 17.535 2 12.026 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kamilzak00/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="linkedin"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 30 30"
            style="fill: #1b1b1b;transform: ;msFilter:;"
            ><path
              d="M24,4H6C4.895,4,4,4.895,4,6v18c0,1.105,0.895,2,2,2h18c1.105,0,2-0.895,2-2V6C26,4.895,25.105,4,24,4z M10.954,22h-2.95 v-9.492h2.95V22z M9.449,11.151c-0.951,0-1.72-0.771-1.72-1.72c0-0.949,0.77-1.719,1.72-1.719c0.948,0,1.719,0.771,1.719,1.719 C11.168,10.38,10.397,11.151,9.449,11.151z M22.004,22h-2.948v-4.616c0-1.101-0.02-2.517-1.533-2.517 c-1.535,0-1.771,1.199-1.771,2.437V22h-2.948v-9.492h2.83v1.297h0.04c0.394-0.746,1.356-1.533,2.791-1.533 c2.987,0,3.539,1.966,3.539,4.522V22z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:hi@kamil.codes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="email">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            style="fill: #1b1b1b;transform: ;msFilter:;"
            ><path
              d="M20 4H6c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v5h2V8l6.4 4.8a1.001 1.001 0 0 0 1.2 0L20 8v9h-8v2h8c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2V6c0-1.103-.897-2-2-2zm-7 6.75L6.666 6h12.668L13 10.75z"
            ></path><path d="M2 12h7v2H2zm2 3h6v2H4zm3 3h4v2H7z"></path></svg
          >
        </a>
      </nav>
    </section>
    <section class="flex flex-col space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What do I do?</h2>
      <p class="text-[#1b1b1b] text-sm font-normal 3xl:text-base">
        Currently, I'm working at <a
          class="text-[#00aeef] hover:underline hover:cursor-pointer font-bold"
          href="https://home.barclays/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">Barclays</a
        >, where I'm modernising a large-scale enterprise artifact and container platform handling
        120M+ operations daily into resilient, distributed infrastructure. Previously at Barclays, I
        worked on a greenfield, high-throughput payment tracking platform processing 1.5B+ payment
        events monthly.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#1b1b1b] text-sm font-normal 3xl:text-base">
        Prior to that, I worked at <a
          class="italic underline hover:cursor-pointer"
          href="https://badgermapping.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">Badger Maps</a
        >, a San Francisco-based sales software startup helping field teams plan routes and manage
        their territories, and <a
          class="italic underline hover:cursor-pointer"
          href="https://loopsio.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">loopsio</a
        >, a dynamic agency engineering bespoke software solutions for clients. I also served as a
        Fractional Lead Developer for a Scottish award-winning startup creating data-driven business
        modeling tools for entrepreneurs (hire #1).
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="flex flex-col space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Outside of work</h2>
      <p class="text-[#1b1b1b] text-sm font-normal 3xl:text-base">
        In my free time, I'm building <a
          class="italic underline hover:cursor-pointer"
          href="https://github.com/allocate-planner/allocate"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">allocate</a
        >, a calendar web product with a custom LLM pipeline that turns unstructured speech into
        scheduled, context-enriched events. I'm also working on <a
          class="italic underline hover:cursor-pointer"
          href="https://github.com/k9mil/pail"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">pail</a
        >, a durable job queue with first-class queryable job state, implemented entirely on S3. You
        can explore my open-source work on GitHub.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#1b1b1b] text-sm font-normal 3xl:text-base">
        When I'm not coding, you'll find me running, playing table tennis or blitz chess, watching
        films, or getting lost in a good book.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="flex flex-col space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-[#1b1b1b] text-sm font-normal 3xl:text-base">
        For inquiries or collaboration opportunities, feel free to reach out via <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kamilzak00/"
          class="hover:underline hover:cursor-pointer italic"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a
        > or <a
          href="mailto:hi@kamil.codes"
          class="hover:underline hover:cursor-pointer italic"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">email</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
